2026-09-17T16:30:00Z found it. Host read 16777216 bytes and the webview logged rom 0 bytes. A typed array that size does not survive webview.postMessage. Empty content, Failed to process content file, uninitialised core, then resetCheat trips the table index. My original postMessage theory was right and I dropped it a turn too early.
